      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example array:\nlet entries = [\n    {id = 1, \n     type = expense, \n     category = bills, \n     amount = 100, \n     description = electricity, \n     date = 2026/08/08\n     },\n    {id = 2, \n     type = expense, \n     category = transportation, \n     amount = 2.50, \n     description = subway, \n     date = 2026/08/09\n     }\n]\n\nadd array to local storage\n\nentries.push(newEntry): Adds input information to objects",
