      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Home page (Navigation)\n- Navigation\n- Total balance/income/expenses\n- Contact form (name, email, text/comment) -> local storage\n\nAPI\n- Free API for budget tracker\n- Frankfurter Currency API (https://frankfurter.dev/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- (Random quotes, weather)\n\nResponsiveness\n- media query\n- breakpoints (mobile, desktop)\n\nIf no expenses\n- error message: \"No expense\"\n\nZelda Theme(hidden)?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Home page (Navigation)\n- Navigation\n- Total balance/income/expenses\n- Contact form (name, email, text/comment) -> local storage\n\nAPI\n- Free API for budget tracker\n- Frankfurter Currency API (https://frankfurter.dev/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- (Random quotes, weather)\n\nResponsiveness\n- media query\n- breakpoints (mobile, desktop)\n\nIf no expenses\n- error message: \"No expense\"\n\nZelda Theme(hidden)?",
